      "source_file": "DESIGN/SPECIMENS/element-sets/lego-blocks-n4.html",
      "source_branch": "nitro/design-specimens-tmp",
      "html": "<section style=\"--sc:#55b9ee\">\n    <p class=\"secnum\">02 \u00b7 Buttons</p>\n    <h2 class=\"law\">Black heart. White voice. Visible skin.</h2>\n    <p class=\"secdeck\">A button reads as a button before it is touched: <strong style=\"color:#fff\">#050505</strong> center, white text, a real icon, a 1.5px+ white rim at rest \u2014 then purple fire for chrome, or its own spectrum color when it belongs to a themed thing. The glyph is a promise: it shows what happens.</p>\n    <div class=\"demo\">\n      <div class=\"demo-row\">\n        <button class=\"cx-btn\" type=\"button\">\u2709&nbsp; WRITE MAIL</button>\n        <button class=\"cx-btn\" type=\"button\">\uff0b&nbsp; ADD CONNECTION</button>\n        <button class=\"cx-btn\" type=\"button\">\u2192&nbsp; OPEN REPORT</button>\n        <span style=\"--sc:#40d3bb\"><button class=\"sp-join\" style=\"--sc:#40d3bb\">\uff0b Join the space</button></span>\n        <span style=\"--sc:#ff5e6c\"><button class=\"sp-join\" style=\"--sc:#ff5e6c\">\u2713 Joined</button></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"states\">\n        <div class=\"state\"><b>IDLE</b><button class=\"cx-btn\" type=\"button\">REST</button><p style=\"font-size:14px; color:#fff; opacity:.8; margin:10px 0 0\">White rim visible. Quiet.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"state\"><b>HOVER</b><button class=\"cx-btn\" type=\"button\" style=\"border-color:#9d75ff; box-shadow:0 0 30px -2px #9d75ff;\">FIRE</button><p style=\"font-size:14px; color:#fff; opacity:.8; margin:10px 0 0\">Own color ignites. Lifts.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"state\"><b>PRESS</b><button class=\"cx-btn\" type=\"button\" style=\"transform:scale(.97)\">TOUCH</button><p style=\"font-size:14px; color:#fff; opacity:.8; margin:10px 0 0\">Compresses. Alive.</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
      "css_classes": [
        ".secnum",
        ".law",
        ".secdeck",
        ".demo",
        ".demo-row",
        ".states",
        ".state"
      ],
      "function": "The lego section anatomy: number, law headline, deck copy, demo row, live states. One spectrum color per section.",
      "props": {
        "tunable": [
          "accent_color",
          "number",
          "headline",
          "deck"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "naya_id": "section.why-section",
      "human_label": "Why-section shell with bullets",
      "category": "section",
      "source_file": "DESIGN/SPECIMENS/element-sets/jewel-library-n5.html",
      "source_branch": "nitro/design-specimens-tmp",
      "html": "<div class=\"lego-section\">\n<h2>01 \u00b7 Orbs \u2014 finished objects of light</h2>\n<p class=\"why\"><strong>Why:</strong> A jewel is a cut stone. An <strong>orb</strong> is a finished object \u2014 spherical, orbital, lit from within. Each holds one spectrum color at its core. A ring of light circles every orb. Hover \u2014 the orbit flares and the orb lifts toward you. <strong>Use for:</strong> bullets, section marks, app icons, truth states.</p>\n<div class=\"orb-row\">\n  <div class=\"orb-wrap\"><span class=\"orb\" style=\"--oc:#e84fff;--oc-rgb:232,79,255\"></span><p class=\"micro\">MAGENTA<small>The living edge</small></p></div>\n  <div class=\"orb-wrap\"><span class=\"orb\" style=\"--oc:#a06bff;--oc-rgb:160,107,255\"></span><p class=\"micro\">PURPLE<small>Naya's presence</small></p></div>\n  <div class=\"orb-wrap\"><span class=\"orb\" style=\"--oc:#3fb8ff;--oc-rgb:63,184,255\"></span><p class=\"micro\">BLUE<small>Knowledge moving</small></p></div>\n  <div class=\"orb-wrap\"><span class=\"orb\" style=\"--oc:#2fe89e;--oc-rgb:47,232,158\"></span><p class=\"micro\">GREEN<small>Alive and well</small></p></div>\n  <div class=\"orb-wrap\"><span class=\"orb\" style=\"--oc:#ffbf3d;--oc-rgb:255,191,61\"></span><p class=\"micro\">GOLD<small>Attention, earned</small></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"orb-scale\">\n  <div class=\"orb-demo\"><span class=\"orb orb--xs\" style=\"--oc:#e84fff;--oc-rgb:232,79,255\"></span><p class=\"micro\">BULLET \u00b7 30px<small>Lists, gem points</small></p></div>\n  <div class=\"orb-demo\"><span class=\"orb orb--sm\" style=\"--oc:#3fb8ff;--oc-rgb:63,184,255\"></span><p class=\"micro\">SECTION MARK \u00b7 56px<small>Room icons, headers</small></p></div>\n  <div class=\"orb-demo\"><span class=\"orb orb--black\" style=\"--oc:#2fe89e;--oc-rgb:47,232,158\"></span><p class=\"micro\">BLACK ORB \u00b7 120px<small>Dark soul, color rim</small></p></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"orb-hero-stage\">\n  <div class=\"orb-hero-wrap\"><span class=\"orb orb--hero\" style=\"--oc:#a06bff;--oc-rgb:160,107,255\"></span></div>\n  <p class=\"micro\">HERO ORB \u00b7 200px<small>Twin counter-rotating orbits. The centerpiece \u2014 one per page, never more.</small></p>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size:22px;margin:44px 0 4px\">Orb variants.</h3>\n<p style=\"color:var(--quiet);font-size:16px;margin:0 0 8px\">Glyphs at the core turn orbs into app icons. Twin rings double the orbit. The orb button presses like something real.</p>\n<div class=\"orb-row\">\n  <div class=\"orb-wrap\"><span class=\"orb orb--glyph\" style=\"--oc:#e84fff;--oc-rgb:232,79,255\">\u2726</span><p class=\"micro\">APP ICON<small>Glyph at the core</small></p></div>\n  <div class=\"orb-wrap\"><span class=\"orb orb--glyph\" style=\"--oc:#3fb8ff;--oc-rgb:63,184,255\">\u2665</span><p class=\"micro\">APP ICON<small>Love, luminous</small></p></div>\n  <div class=\"orb-wrap\"><span class=\"orb orb--twin\" style=\"--oc:#2fe89e;--oc-rgb:47,232,158\"></span><p class=\"micro\">TWIN ORBIT<small>Two rings, counter-rotating</small></p></div>\n  <div class=\"orb-wrap\"><button class=\"orb orb--btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Activate orb\" style=\"--oc:#ffbf3d;--oc-rgb:255,191,61\"></button><p class=\"micro\">ORB BUTTON<small>Press it \u2014 it gives</small></p></div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size:22px;margin:44px 0 4px\">Truth orbs.</h3>\n<p style=\"color:var(--quiet);font-size:16px;margin:0 0 8px\">The truth language, as objects. Green is proven. Gold is shown. Blue is stated.</p>\n<div class=\"orb-row\">\n  <div class=\"orb-wrap\"><span class=\"orb orb--sm\" style=\"--oc:#2fe89e;--oc-rgb:47,232,158\"></span><p class=\"micro\">VERIFIED<small>Proven, glowing green</small></p></div>\n  <div class=\"orb-wrap\"><span class=\"orb orb--sm\" style=\"--oc:#ffbf3d;--oc-rgb:255,191,61\"></span><p class=\"micro\">DEMONSTRATION<small>Shown, golden</small></p></div>\n  <div class=\"orb-wrap\"><span class=\"orb orb--sm\" style=\"--oc:#3fb8ff;--oc-rgb:63,184,255\"></span><p class=\"micro\">CLAIM<small>Stated, quiet blue</small></p></div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size:22px;margin:44px 0 4px\">Orbs in context.</h3>\n<p style=\"color:var(--quiet);font-size:16px;margin:0 0 8px\">Where orbs live in real interfaces \u2014 bullets, section marks, app icons.</p>\n<div class=\"orb-context\">\n  <div class=\"orb-ctx-card\">\n    <h4>Bullets</h4>\n    <ul class=\"orb-bullet-list\">\n      <li><span class=\"orb orb--xs\" style=\"--oc:#e84fff;--oc-rgb:232,79,255\"></span>Every list item earns its light</li>\n      <li><span class=\"orb orb--xs\" style=\"--oc:#a06bff;--oc-rgb:160,107,255\"></span>Spectrum order, never twice adjacent</li>\n      <li><span class=\"orb orb--xs\" style=\"--oc:#3fb8ff;--oc-rgb:63,184,255\"></span>Small but never flat</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"orb-ctx-card\">\n    <h4><span class=\"orb orb--sm\" style=\"--oc:#a06bff;--oc-rgb:160,107,255\"></span>Section marks</h4>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--quiet);font-size:15px\">A 56px orb beside a heading turns a title into a destination. One color per section, in spectrum order.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"orb-ctx-card\">\n    <h4>App icons</h4>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center\">\n      <span class=\"orb orb--glyph orb--icon\" style=\"--oc:#e84fff;--oc-rgb:232,79,255\">\u2726</span>\n      <span class=\"orb orb--glyph orb--icon\" style=\"--oc:#2fe89e;--oc-rgb:47,232,158\">\u25b6</span>\n      <span class=\"orb orb--glyph orb--icon\" style=\"--oc:#ffbf3d;--oc-rgb:255,191,61\">\u25c8</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;color:var(--quiet);font-size:15px\">64px glyph orbs \u2014 the icon set for rooms and apps.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<button class=\"copy-btn\" onclick=\"copyCode('orbCode')\">Copy orb system</button>\n<pre class=\"code\" id=\"orbCode\">&lt;!-- ORB \u2014 one object, every scale. Set --oc / --oc-rgb to any spectrum color. --&gt;\n&lt;span class=\"orb\" style=\"--oc:#e84fff;--oc-rgb:232,79,255\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\n&lt;span class=\"orb orb--sm\" style=\"--oc:#3fb8ff;--oc-rgb:63,184,255\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;!-- section mark --&gt;\n&lt;span class=\"orb orb--xs\" style=\"--oc:#2fe89e;--oc-rgb:47,232,158\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;!-- bullet --&gt;\n&lt;span class=\"orb orb--black\" style=\"--oc:#ffbf3d;--oc-rgb:255,191,61\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;!-- black variant --&gt;\n&lt;span class=\"orb orb--hero\" style=\"--oc:#a06bff;--oc-rgb:160,107,255\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;!-- hero: wrap in .orb-hero-wrap for twin orbits --&gt;\n&lt;span class=\"orb orb--glyph\" style=\"--oc:#e84fff;--oc-rgb:232,79,255\"&gt;\u2726&lt;/span&gt; &lt;!-- app icon --&gt;\n&lt;span class=\"orb orb--twin\" style=\"--oc:#2fe89e;--oc-rgb:47,232,158\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;!-- twin rings --&gt;\n&lt;button class=\"orb orb--btn\" style=\"--oc:#ffbf3d;--oc-rgb:255,191,61\" aria-label=\"Activate\"&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n\n&lt;style&gt;\n.orb { --oc:#a06bff; --oc-rgb:160,107,255; position:relative; display:inline-block;\n  width:120px; height:120px; border-radius:50%;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(circle at 34% 26%, rgba(255,255,255,.95) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,.30) 13%, transparent 30%),\n    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 62%, rgba(255,255,255,.10) 0%, transparent 42%),\n    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, var(--oc) 0%, var(--oc) 56%, #040406 100%);\n  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px rgba(255,255,255,.5), inset 0 -12px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.62),\n    0 0 30px rgba(var(--oc-rgb),.55), 0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.65);\n  animation: orb-breathe 5s ease-in-out infinite; }\n.orb::before { /* orbiting ring of light */\n  content:\"\"; position:absolute; inset:-17px; border-radius:50%;\n  background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent 0deg, transparent 282deg,\n    rgba(var(--oc-rgb),.85) 328deg, rgba(255,255,255,.95) 350deg, transparent 360deg);\n  -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n  -webkit-mask-composite: xor; mask-composite: exclude; padding:3px;\n  animation: orb-spin 6s linear infinite; }\n.orb:hover { transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.06); }\n.orb:hover::before { animation-duration:1.5s; }\n@keyframes orb-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n@keyframes orb-breathe { 0%,100% { transform:scale(1); } 50% { transform:scale(1.045); } }\n.orb--sm { width:56px; height:56px; } .orb--sm::before { inset:-10px; }\n.orb--xs { width:30px; height:30px; } .orb--xs::before { inset:-7px; }\n.orb--black { background:\n    radial-gradient(circle at 34% 26%, rgba(255,255,255,.55) 0%, transparent 26%),\n    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 55%, #1b1b22 0%, #050507 72%);\n  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(var(--oc-rgb),.9), 0 0 30px rgba(var(--oc-rgb),.5); }\n/* \u2014 expansion: hero, glyph, twin, pressable \u2014 */\n.orb--hero { width:200px; height:200px; }\n.orb--hero::before { inset:-26px; padding:4px; animation-duration:9s; }\n.orb-hero-wrap { position:relative; display:inline-block; padding:38px; }\n.orb-hero-wrap::before { content:\"\"; position:absolute; inset:0; border-radius:50%; pointer-events:none; opacity:.55;\n  background:conic-gradient(from 180deg, transparent 0deg, transparent 298deg, rgba(255,255,255,.75) 338deg, transparent 360deg);\n  -webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n  -webkit-mask-composite:xor; mask-composite:exclude; padding:2px;\n  animation:orb-spin-rev 16s linear infinite; }\n@keyframes orb-spin-rev { to { transform:rotate(-360deg); } }\n.orb--twin::after { inset:-30px; left:auto; right:auto; top:auto; bottom:auto; height:auto; border-radius:50%; filter:none; z-index:auto;\n  background:conic-gradient(from 90deg, transparent 0deg, transparent 310deg, rgba(var(--oc-rgb),.6) 345deg, transparent 360deg);\n  -webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n  -webkit-mask-composite:xor; mask-composite:exclude; padding:2px;\n  animation:orb-spin-rev 11s linear infinite; opacity:.7; }\n.orb--glyph { display:inline-grid; place-items:center; font-size:46px; color:#fff;\n  text-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.75), 0 0 22px rgba(var(--oc-rgb),.95); }\n.orb--icon { width:64px; height:64px; font-size:26px; }\n.orb--icon::before { inset:-11px; padding:2px; }\nbutton.orb--btn { cursor:pointer; font-family:inherit; border:none; }\n.orb--btn:active { transform:scale(.9); transition:transform .1s ease; }\n&lt;/style&gt;</pre>\n</div>",
      "css_classes": [
        ".lego-section",
        ".why",
        ".gem-list",
        ".gem-bullet"
      ],
      "function": "Section shell with a 'Why' rationale block and a gem-bullet list cycling the spectrum. Teaches while it shows.",
      "props": {
        "tunable": [
          "title",
          "why",
          "items"
        ]
      }
    },
