      "source_branch": "nitro/design-specimens-tmp",
      "html": "<ul class=\"gem-list\">\n  <li><span class=\"gem-bullet\" style=\"--tone:var(--magenta)\"></span>Color has four jobs. Never cross them.</li>\n  <li><span class=\"gem-bullet\" style=\"--tone:var(--purple)\"></span>Black heart. White voice. Visible skin.</li>\n  <li><span class=\"gem-bullet\" style=\"--tone:var(--blue)\"></span>One board. One color. A destination you enter.</li>\n  <li><span class=\"gem-bullet\" style=\"--tone:var(--green)\"></span>Size separates. Color doesn't.</li>\n  <li><span class=\"gem-bullet\" style=\"--tone:var(--gold)\"></span>Every bullet a jewel. Never twice in a row.</li>\n</ul>",
