      "html": "<footer>\n  <div class=\"spectrum-bar\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n  <p>THE NAYA ULTIMATE LEGO LIBRARY \u00b7 One standard. Every page. No drift.</p>\n  <p class=\"micro\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Black ground \u00b7 White light \u00b7 Purple soul \u00b7 Magenta leads</p>\n  <p class=\"micro\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">Your idea. Your intelligence. Your Smart App. Your internet, your way.</p>\n</footer>",
