      "source_branch": "nitro/design-specimens-tmp",
      "html": "<p class=\"kicker\">04 \u00b7 A world, not a rectangle</p>\n  <h2><span class=\"n\">04</span>One board. One color. A destination you enter.</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\">The board is the intelligent object: <strong>theme-edged, jewel-marked, elevated.</strong> One spectrum color per board \u2014 spine, kicker, corner jewel all speak it. Text stays white. Inside, meaning nests: the nutshell, then what it means, how to use it.</p>",
